id=malachite_offmode_flag
name=malachite off-mode charging fix (test)
version=1.2
versionCode=3
author=noamtu123
description=Keeps Xiaomi's power_off_mode flag at 1 while Android runs, so a cable plugged into a switched-off phone shows the charging screen. Logs every start: FAIL if the cable started Android, what the bootloader saw. Action button: status + copies the log to Download/malachite_offmode.txt.
